{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_26_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_26","textTraditional":"一、十有五年，春，二月，天王使家父來求車。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_26_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_26","textTraditional":"古者諸侯時獻於天子，以其國之所有。故有辭讓，而無徵求。求車，非禮也，求金甚矣。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_26_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_26","textTraditional":"二、三月，乙未，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_26_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_26","textTraditional":"三、四月，己巳，葬齊僖公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_26_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_26","textTraditional":"四、五月，鄭伯突出奔蔡。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_26_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_26","textTraditional":"譏奪正也。鄭世子忽復歸於鄭。反正也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_26_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_26","textTraditional":"五、許叔入於許。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_26_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_26","textTraditional":"許叔，許之貴者也，莫宜乎許叔，其曰入何也？其歸之道，非所以歸也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_26_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_26","textTraditional":"六、公會齊侯於蒿。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_26_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_26","textTraditional":"七、邾人、牟人、葛人來朝。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_26_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_26","textTraditional":"八、秋，九月，鄭伯突入於櫟。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_26_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_26","textTraditional":"九、冬，十有一月，公會宋公、衞侯、陳侯於袳，伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_26_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_26","textTraditional":"地而後伐，疑也，非其疑也。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}